ls.2.1[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-ls/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bob-cli-ls.2.1.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Typed subscription registry and deterministic matching[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]registry_match[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]registry_match: load the subscription album by noun, validate typed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]records and match needles, expose snapshot-based parsing and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]deterministic match provenance, and cover failures with synthetic tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared charge attribution and subscription ledger[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]attribution_ledger[dim] · [dim][/dim]after registry_match[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]attribution_ledger: build the deduplicated journal-and-row universe, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolve explicit links and eligible pattern matches, derive [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]coverage-aware subscription ledger facts, and test integer money and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]calendar boundaries.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Guarded loaders, row JSON, suggestions, and documentation[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]integrate[dim] · [dim][/dim]after registry_match, attribution_ledger[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]integrate: generalize the guarded restaurant loader, integrate the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]shared subscription snapshot into list/report/import row JSON and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]category suggestions, surface bounded availability warnings, document [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the contract, and verify the full core scope.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":