":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-ls[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Subscriptions album: records that know how they show up on the [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]statement[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]A 🔁 Subscriptions album under bank holds every discretionary [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]recurring charge, seeded from a reviewed bank history. bob bank [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]import links each new matching row to its record, and the link [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]renders as a quiet 🔁 chip. bob bank check and bob bank [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]subscriptions keep the album honest: they flag price changes, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]charges after a cancel, and possible new subscriptions. The old [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Zorg recurring table retires without losing a link, and bob-cli-kt [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]closes.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]10[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bank_subscriptions_album.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/bank_subscriptions_album.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-ls[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-ls/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Seed the album from a reviewed bank history[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]seed[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]seed: create the subscriptions album with the full schema, regenerate [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the evidence from the bank journal, ask Bryan one question round, write [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the reviewed records, add obligation bank rules, and hand-link the live [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rows.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Subscription registry, match resolver, and ledger[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core: load subscription records, implement the Shows-up-as match [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract and the single attribution resolver over rows and journal [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]history, derive each record's ledger, and add subscription fields to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bank row JSON.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Retire old_recur.md into a legacy_recur notebook[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]legacy[dim] · [dim][/dim]after seed[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]legacy: move the Zorg table into a legacy_recur notebook under cash, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]keep every block ID, point historical links for discretionary rows at [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]their records and every other link at the notebook, and point the cash [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]audit task at the album.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Import links new rows to their subscription[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]import[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]import: insert the subscription tier into import naming (rule, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]subscription, learned without subscription links, restaurant), fill in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]payee and category, and add the import summary line.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Subscription findings in bob bank check[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]check[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]check: report charged-after-cancel, still-charging, price-change, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]candidate, invalid-needle, overlap, and unknown-category findings, with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]paste-ready fixes. A bank rule doubles as a candidate's dismissal.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The bob bank subscriptions command[/bold #D7AFFF]                            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]report[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core, check[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]report: add the read-only bob bank subscriptions report with beautiful [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]human output and the JSON contract every plugin surface reads, plus the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]audit guide.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]🔁 chips on bank rows[/bold #D7AFFF]                                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]chips[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]chips: render subscription links as state-aware 🔁 pills in Live [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Preview, Reading view, and the queue card, with tooltips, ghost chips, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and click-to-link.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  8 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Category card subscription linker[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]linker[dim] · [dim][/dim]after chips, report[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]linker: add the slash picker, the context strip, and the New [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]subscription sheet to the Category card, and connect ghost-chip clicks [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]to them.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  9 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Record header strip and album summary card[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]surfaces[dim] · [dim][/dim]after linker, report[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]surfaces: draw the per-record header strip with its charge timeline, the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]album summary card, and the formatted index rows on the subscriptions [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]album.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  10 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Vault acceptance, memory, and closing bob-cli-kt[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]acceptance[dim] · [dim][/dim]after legacy, import, surfaces[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]acceptance: prove the delivered system on the real vault, keep the vault[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]candidate-clean, link rows written since the seed, land the accepted [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]memory, and close bob-cli-kt.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-ls","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-ls.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-a95312cd1df2149e619791e8099257eb","started_at":"2026-11-15T18:14:06.835770+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"2eff9c9433daa7730b6cf66999c195a3d09100a3321d7c537882b5ba924e7b95","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-ls.2--mon/chat.md","size_bytes":2444},"commits":{"digest":"a2472655564a1d56507562052cb188f19a694e2ff06918da1515f1db0a9b3eda","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-ls.2--mon/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"b06985daf7ad84639776bbec096f3b1d68d37e9220b53bdb4dded4796008f148","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-ls.2--mon/meta.json","size_bytes":754},"state":{"digest":"927867be18a6504f824aa464faf0ce7540ff1f11d37f08ca53f415c3b88352b5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-ls.2--mon/state.json","size_bytes":213}},"finished_at":"20